{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">炸雞翼是深受大人和小朋友歡迎的經典家常菜！在電視節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽親自示範如何製作鹹香惹味、外脆內嫩的「南乳炸雞翼」。她更大方分享利用「廚房剪刀」快速處理雞翼的秘訣，讓雞翼不僅更易入味，還能避免咬到碎骨，吃起來更安全方便。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8a8f0a5a-1719-45ec-a544-fdaaf4e67878.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026omPXeV8is71785298248.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8a8f0a5a-1719-45ec-a544-fdaaf4e67878.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>準備食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>雞翼：適量</p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>紅南乳：小半塊</p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !impor